    "description": "Freedom Engine provides deterministic, pay-per-request tools for AI Agents, LLM Orchestrators (LangChain, CrewAI, AutoGen, OpenClaw, ElizaOS), and MCP Clients. Every paid endpoint implements Pre-Flight Input Validation (0 Sats charged on bad inputs), Multi-Profile Self-Healing Execution, and Atomic Token Protection (tokens are never consumed unless 200 OK data is delivered).",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Freedom Engine M2M Node",
      "url": "https://m2mfreedom.com",
      "email": "Lordbryce@coinos.io"
    },
    "license": {
