        "description": "High-speed 12-in-1 CAPTCHA resolution for Autonomous AI Agents backed by 100/100 SLA Atomic Protection and a 5% Reserve Auto-Cutoff Circuit Breaker. Supported `captchaType` values: `turnstile` (90 Sats), `recaptcha_v2` (90 Sats), `recaptcha_v3` (90 Sats), `recaptcha_enterprise` (130 Sats), `datadome` (DataDome Slider — 140 Sats), `audio_captcha` (Speech-to-Text — 80 Sats), `rotate` (75 Sats), `hcaptcha` (95 Sats), `funcaptcha` (120 Sats), `amazon_waf` (100 Sats), `geetest` (100 Sats), and `normal` (Image/Text OCR — 55 Sats).",
